//// rakun-actuator-api — module-tree root (front 11 Step 0).
////
//// The dependency-free half of the actuator: the contract (`Health`,
//// `HealthIndicator`, `InfoContributor`, `Endpoint`, `EndpointResponse`), the
//// registration cells and their four decorators, and the span seam. Every
//// module that ships an indicator, a contributor or an endpoint depends on this
//// member and never on the host (`modules/rakun-actuator`), so the wave table
//// has no cycle. A registration is API; a decision is host.
////
//// The order is a DEPENDENCY order and `botopink.json`'s `files` repeats it:
//// `registration` imports `contract`; `span` imports nothing.

pub mod contract;
pub mod registration;
pub mod span;
